abstract: >-
  Papers, code, data and machine-checked proofs (Lean 4, DRAT) for results on
  open problems in mathematics. Current problem: the Erdős–Gyárfás conjecture
  (graphs without cycles whose length is a power of two). Code in
  results/cubic-bipartite-power-of-two-cycles/src is MIT-licensed (adapted from
  Julius Tranquilli); everything else is CC0.
